  "description": "东莞博可威电子科技有限公司（BKW）成立于2018年，专注于高性能薄膜电容器的研发、设计与销售，提供ODM/OEM服务，从研发设计到量产交付全程把关，可依客户需求定制各类规格产品。客户遍及华南、华东等多个省份。 Dongguan BoKeWei Electronic Technology Co., Ltd (BKW), founded in 2018, focuses on the R&D, design and sales of high-performance film capacitors and provides ODM/OEM services, overseeing the process from design through to volume delivery. Customers are located across multiple provinces in South and East China.",
